    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about the decor. it's just that the person who lived here... the person i was when we were together... they're just gone. i try to do things, like go to work or eat, but it feels so hollow. like there's no point in maintaining a life for someone who doesn't even exist anymore. it's just a lot of empty effort.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
